{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46647","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见苔钱 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见苔钱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见苔钱，规模遍地圆。\n儿童扫不破，子母自相连。\n润屋何曾有，缘墙谩可怜。\n虚教作铜臭，空使外人传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}